          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jiëc Yecu li̱th",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ cäŋ in jio̱l kä juɔk nikɛ runwaŋ a ŋot ɣɔw nikɛ cuɔl cu Mɛri, raan Mag-da-la, ben kɔ̱kä kunyä, kä cuɛ jɛ nɛn ɛn ɣöö ca päm woc thok kɔ̱kä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä inɔ cuɛ riŋ, kä cuɛ jɛ wä la̱r Thay-mɔn Pi-tɔr kɛnɛ jak in dɔ̱ŋ min nhɔk Yecu jɛ, kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Cikɛ Kuäär ni Kuoth woc rɛy kɔ̱kä kunyä, kä kueckɔ gua̱a̱th ɔ ca jɛ la̱th thi̱n ɔ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Pi-tɔr kɛnɛ jak in dɔ̱ŋ ben raar, kä cukɛ wä luɔtkɛ ni gua̱a̱th kunyä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riŋkɛ kɛn da̱ŋ rɛw kɛɛl, kä cu jak in dɔ̱ŋ Pi-tɔr leny, kä cu kɔŋ cop ni jɛn kɔ̱kä kunyä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ rɔ goŋ guicɛ rɛydɛ. Kä cuɛ jɛ nɛn te bieyni tëë ca rith ni Yecu piny, kä /kenɛ wä rɛc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Thay-mɔn Pi-tɔr cop kɔɔrɛ, kä cuɛ coth rɛc. Kä cuɛ bieyni tëë ca rith ni Yecu nɛn piny, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä bi̱i̱ ëë ca kum ni nhiam Yecu /cɛ te kɛɛl kɛ bieyni tëë ca rith ni jɛ, duundɛ ɣöö tëë go̱lä a ca jɛ riy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä inɔ cu jak in dɔ̱ŋ min kɔŋ cop ni jɛn gua̱a̱th kunyä wä rɛc bä, kä cuɛ jɛ nɛn, kä cuɛ jɛ ŋäth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ŋotkɛ /ken ruaacni Kuɔth tëë ca gɔ̱r ni cop lɔɔcdiɛn, ɛn ɣöö bɛ rɔ dhil jiɛc li̱th. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu jaak loc ciëëŋnikiɛn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyuth Yecu kɛ rɔ Mɛri raan Mag-da-la",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duundɛ ɣöö cu Mɛri cuɔ̱ŋ thok kɔ̱kä kunyä ro̱tdɛ. Kä min ro̱tdɛ, cuɛ rɔ goŋ kɛ ɣöö bɛ rɛy kɔ̱kä guic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ja̱a̱k nhial da̱ŋ rɛw ti ciaŋkɛ bieyni ti bo̱o̱r nɛn, nyuurä guäth ëë ca puɔ̱ny Yecu tɔa̱a̱c thi̱n, te kɛl guäth wecdɛ kä te min dɔ̱ŋ guäth ciöknikɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kɛn ɛ jiök i̱, “Ciek, ɛŋu ro̱li mɔ?” Cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Ɛ ɣöö ci kɛn Kuäärä naŋ, kä kuecä gua̱a̱th ɔ ca jɛ la̱th thi̱n ɔ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min cɛ mɛmɛ lat, cuɛ rɔ ri̱t, kä cuɛ Yecu nɛn cuŋä, kä /kenɛ jɛ ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö ɛ Yecu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yecu ɛ jiök i̱, “Ciek, ɛŋu ro̱li mɔ? Ɛŋa go̱o̱ri mɔ?” Kä cuɛ jɛ car i̱ dɔ̱ŋ ɛ yieen kakä, cuɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Mi ci jɛ naŋ guäth mi dɔ̱ŋ, läri ɣä gua̱a̱th ɔ ci jɛ la̱th thi̱n ɔ, kä bä jɛ wä naŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yecu jɛ cɔl cio̱tdä i̱, “Mɛri.” Kä cuɛ rɔɔdɛ riet jɛ, kä cuɛ jɛ jiök kɛ thok Ɣi-bɛ-ru i̱, “Ra-bo-ni,” min luɔtdɛ ɣöö “Ŋi̱i̱c.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yecu jɛ jiök i̱, “/Cu ɣä gueer, kɛ ɣöö ŋuɔtdä /ka̱n ni wä nhial kä Gua̱a̱r. Duundɛ ɣöö wër jio̱kni dämaari i̱, ‘Ɣän wa̱a̱ nhial kä Gua̱a̱r in la Guurun, kä Kuothdä min la Kuothdun.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Mɛri raan Mag-da-la jɛ wä la̱r jaak i̱, “Ɣän cä Kuäär ni Kuoth nɛn,” kä cuɛ kɛ la̱t ruaacni tin ca la̱r jɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyuth Yecu kɛ rɔ jaakɛ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ thiaŋ ɛmɔ kɛ jɛn cäŋ in jio̱l kä juɔk, kä te thi̱ekni duëël in te jaak thi̱n gääkä, kɛ ɣöö dualkɛ kɛ ji̱ Juudh. Kä cu Yecu ben cuɔ̱ŋ dääriɛn, kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “A mal tekɛ yɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔr kä mëë cɛ mɛmɛ lar, cuɛ kɛ nyuɔ̱th tetkɛ kɛnɛ bua̱lɛ. Kä cu jaak lo̱ckiɛn tɛɛth ɛlɔ̱ŋ, mëë cikɛ Kuäär nɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yecu kɛ nyɔk kɛ jio̱k i̱, “A mal tekɛ yɛ. Ce̱tkɛ min ci Gua̱a̱r ɣä ja̱k, ɣän ja̱kä yɛ bä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë cɛ mɛmɛ lar, cuɛ kɛ ŋök yiëë, kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Ka̱nɛ Yiëë in Gɔaa in Rɛl Rɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi wä yɛn dueer ran wä päl, ba kɛ päl. Kä mi rɔm yɛn dueer ran, ba kɛ rɔm.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yecu kɛnɛ thil ŋäthä Tɔ-mäth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä Tɔ-mäth min la ram kɛl kä jaak da̱ŋ wäl wi̱cdɛ rɛw, kä cɔal ɛ i̱ “Cuɛ̈k”, tëë jɔ̱ɔ̱r mëë bä Yecu kä kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu jaak tin kɔ̱kiɛn ɛ jiök i̱, “Kɔn cakɔ Kuäär nɛn.” Kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Ɛ ni mi cä buɔ̱ɔ̱t thötni nɛn pa̱a̱t tetnikɛ kä cäkɛ thiap kɛ yiatdä, kä cä tetdä la̱th bua̱lädɛ, bä cu ŋäth.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kɔr ni̱ni da̱ŋ bärɔw cu jaak lɛ te rɛy duëël, kä te Tɔ-mäth kɛ kɛ kɛɛl. Cäŋɛ ni mëë ca thiekni duëël ga̱k, cu Yecu wä rɛc, kä cuɛ cuɔ̱ŋ dääriɛn, cuɛ wee i̱, “A mal tekɛ yɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ Tɔ-mäth jiök i̱, “Läthni yiatdu wanɛ mɛ, kä guic pa̱a̱t tetnikä. No̱o̱ŋni tetdu kä läthni jɛ bua̱lädä. A lɔcdu /ci tekɛ diw, kä ŋäth ɣä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Tɔ-mäth ɛ loc i̱, “Kuäärä, kä Kuothdä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yecu jɛ jiök i̱, “Ŋääthi ɣä kɛ ɣöö ci ɣä nɛn? Ɛpuc, puɔ̱th akɛ nɛy tin ŋa̱thkɛ ɣä ɛ /ka̱n ɣä nɛn.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Min lot bok ɛ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
